            "heading": "Fabric grown from trees."
          }
        },
        "text_8VjBw4": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Our fibre comes from eucalyptus pulp, grown in managed forests.<\/p><p>Naturally breathable. Temperature-regulating. Soft in Mumbai's worst.<\/p><p>Polyester traps heat. Smells faster. Sits heavy. Ours breathes, releases moisture, stays gentle.<\/p><p>Made in a closed-loop process. Every drop of water recycled. Every fibre traceable.<\/p><p><strong>This is what your skin remembers.<\/strong><\/p>"
          }
        },
